<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta shares index hits new high on active buying.</title>
<headline>Jakarta shares index hits new high on active buying.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jakarta's share index hit new high of 730.19 points in late morning trade on Tuesday after active buying of secondaries as well as blue chips Telkom and Sampoerna, brokers said.</p>
